// 线上部署配置（Workers + 静态资源）。静态请求直接命中资源、不消耗 Worker 调用；只有 /api/* 进入 Worker。
// 部署：npx wrangler deploy -c wrangler.worker.jsonc
{
  "$schema": "node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json",
  "name": "haibao-scifi",
  "main": "src/worker.js",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page",
    "run_worker_first": ["/api/*"]
  },
  "d1_databases": [
    { "binding": "DB", "database_name": "haibao", "database_id": "2982a88f-5088-4813-8a57-c3b39751aef8" }
  ],
  "routes": [{ "pattern": "scifi.ironieser.cc", "custom_domain": true }],
  "observability": { "enabled": true }
}
